# Machine-specific: hooks in here hardcode absolute paths to this workstation.
.claude

# graphify: keep the graph output, ignore what regenerates on every update.
# `graphify update .` rewrites these, so tracking them puts unrelated churn
# in every commit. graph.json / graph.html / GRAPH_REPORT.md / manifest.json
# stay tracked.
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
